# Main branch only

Always stay on `main`. Do not create, check out, or push `cursor/*` or other feature branches.

- Fetch and pull `origin/main` only.
- Keep local work on `main`.
- Do not merge or rebase other branches unless Sai explicitly asks.
- Feature branches cause repeated conflict storms in this repo; avoid them.
